{"id":"5512e36aaf9ea56c","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-poset-meet-semilattice.md","title":"ZFC Poset Meet Semilattice","display":"df-zfc-poset-meet-semilattice — ZFC Poset Meet Semilattice","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-poset-meet-semilattice","aliases":["58-df-zfc-poset-meet-semilattice"],"display":"df-zfc-poset-meet-semilattice — ZFC Poset Meet Semilattice","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-poset-meet-semilattice"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-poset-meet-semilattice</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-poset-meet-semilattice — ZFC Poset Meet Semilattice"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P \\in V\">\\(P \\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq\\;\\subseteq P\\times P\">\\(\\leq\\;\\subseteq P\\times P\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a> 的规范定义</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPosetMeetSemilattice}_S \\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPosetMeetSemilattice}_S \\subseteq V^2\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}poset\\text{-}meet\\text{-}semilattice} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPosetMeetSemilattice}_S(P,\\leq)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq)\\land \\forall x,y\\in P\\;\\exists m\\in P\\;\\left(m\\leq x\\land m\\leq y\\land\\forall z\\in P\\;((z\\leq x\\land z\\leq y)\\to z\\leq m)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}poset\\text{-}meet\\text{-}semilattice} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPosetMeetSemilattice}_S(P,\\leq)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq)\\land \\forall x,y\\in P\\;\\exists m\\in P\\;\\left(m\\leq x\\land m\\leq y\\land\\forall z\\in P\\;((z\\leq x\\land z\\leq y)\\to z\\leq m)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 被展开为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\">\\(x,y\\)</span> 的最大下界；偏序的反对称性保证该 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 唯一。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}$ 采用 [[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]] 的规范定义","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P \\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq\\;\\subseteq P\\times P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPosetMeetSemilattice}_S \\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}poset\\text{-}meet\\text{-}semilattice} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPosetMeetSemilattice}_S(P,\\leq)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq)\\land \\forall x,y\\in P\\;\\exists m\\in P\\;\\left(m\\leq x\\land m\\leq y\\land\\forall z\\in P\\;((z\\leq x\\land z\\leq y)\\to z\\leq m)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"x,y","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false}],"bytes":944,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3121","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-poset-meet-semilattice.md|58-df-zfc-poset-meet-semilattice]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","d3f859dbdd37f018"]}